# INCREMENT 1b (same files)
#  - Ordering: Chromium's SetTabStripView reorders the tab list to separator+1; the fork
#    re-inserts the additions at separator+1 so New Chat / header / organizer stay ABOVE the
#    tab list (original builder order).
#  - Layout: BoxLayout rows with fixed button padding (VH(6,10) / VH(4,8)); no vertical growth.
#  - "Recent Chats & Threads" is live: the original's native code fetches the daemon's public
#    loopback route GET http://127.0.0.1:21420/session/for-chrome/recents
